*   #C2 @SET-SYMBOL $CAPACITOR => @PLACE(29, 8) => @ORIENT("R270");
*   $GROUND @ATTACH &VSS(p) => @SET-SYMBOL $GROUND_SYMBOL => @PLACE(26, 8) => @ORIENT("R0") => %gnd6;
